<title>UK: Stg down over two pfennigs vs pre-election levels.</title>
<headline>Stg down over two pfennigs vs pre-election levels.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sterling was more than two pfennigs down in early Europe on Friday from pre-election result levels, traders said.</p>
<p>The pound was at 2.7770/80 marks, down from 2.7970/80 ahead of the election results annoucement. It also weakened against the dollar to $1.6120/30 from $1.6253/60.</p>
<p>The bulk of the decline came just after European trading started.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom + 44 171 542 7792</p>
